              "printed_page": 633,
              "column": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Metastasis to regional lymph nodes, lungs, and peritoneal cavity in dogs is associated with the nodular and diffuse forms of hepatocellular carcinoma.",
              "pdf_page": 715,
              "printed_page": 633,
              "column": 1
